<title>NETHERLANDS: TENNIS-HEINEKEN TROPHY COLLATED RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HEINEKEN TROPHY COLLATED RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ROSMALEN, Netherlands 1997-06-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Collated results at the Heineken Trophy tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix number denotes seed):</p>
<p>Men's semifinals:</p>
<p>3-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) beat 1-Michael Chang (U.S.) 6-7 (5-7) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Guillaume Raoux (France) beat 4-Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) 6-0 6-1</p>
<p>Women's semifinal:</p>
<p>Miriam Oremans (Netherlands) beat 1-Anke Huber (Germany) 4-6 6-4 retired</p>
<p>Women's final</p>
<p>3-Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania) leads Miriam Oremans (Netherlands) 5-7 6-2 3-1</p>
<p>(play halted by slippery court - to be completed on Sunday)</p>
</text>
